	quest.0000000000001001.quest_desc: ["Craft your very first tool. The Forge Hammer is required to shape metal plates and sheets by hand before any machinery exists."]
	quest.0000000000001001.title: "The Hand-Craft Foundations"
	quest.0000000000001002.quest_desc: ["The Bronze Boiler is the starting point of your factory. Feed it with water and solid fuel (like charcoal) to produce Steam."]
	quest.0000000000001002.title: "First Steam Production"
	quest.0000000000001003.quest_desc: ["Stop breaking ores by hand. The Steam Macerator crushes raw ores into dusts, doubling your resource production yield."]
	quest.0000000000001003.title: "Mechanical Pulverization"
	quest.0000000000001004.quest_desc: ["The Steam Compressor processes ingots into plates and rods much faster and without wasting your tools' durability."]
	quest.0000000000001004.title: "Automatic Shaping"
	quest.0000000000001005.quest_desc: ["By using water as a coolant, the Steam Cutting Machine slices metal plates into gears and fine components needed for electronic parts."]
	quest.0000000000001005.title: "Industrial Sawing"
	quest.0000000000001006.quest_desc: ["It's time to step away from direct steam kinetic force. Feed steam into the LV Turbine to generate your first EU (Energy Units)."]
	quest.0000000000001006.title: "Harvesting the Kilowatt"
	quest.0000000000001007.quest_desc: ["The Assembling Machine is the brain of your automated lines. It is mandatory for creating complex electronic components and basic circuits."]
	quest.0000000000001007.title: "Advanced Factory Assembly"
	quest.0000000000001008.quest_desc: ["The Electric Blast Furnace is your first major multi-block structure. Use it to generate extreme temperatures required to melt Steel and Aluminum."]
	quest.0000000000001008.title: "Heavy Metallurgy"
	quest.0000000000001009.quest_desc: ["Crude Oil is mandatory for modern tech tiers. Build this massive Distillation Tower multi-block to separate oil into Heavy Fuel, Light Fuel, and Naphtha."]
	quest.0000000000001009.title: "Petrochemical Fractionation"
	quest.0000000000001010.quest_desc: ["Process your Naphtha fractions inside the Chemical Reactor to produce Polyethylene. Plastic is vital for advanced wiring insulation."]
	quest.0000000000001010.title: "The Plastic Milestone"
	quest.0000000000001011.quest_desc: ["High-tier computing components cannot survive dust pollution. Build a functional Cleanroom multi-block structure. All high-tech components must be assembled inside it."]
	quest.0000000000001011.title: "Sterile Engineering"
	quest.0000000000001012.quest_desc: ["Advanced synthetic compounds and hot metals require rapid cooling before being physically handled. Build a Vacuum Freezer."]
	quest.0000000000001012.title: "Cryogenic Treatment"
	quest.0000000000001013.quest_desc: ["Assembled strictly inside the Cleanroom. Digital Circuits allow your processing lines to manage complex calculations and high voltage requirements."]
	quest.0000000000001013.title: "Digital Logic Blocks"
	quest.0000000000001014.quest_desc: ["Welcome to the endgame. The Nuclear Reactor handles uranium fuel rods to generate astronomical amounts of thermal energy. Mind your coolant cycles carefully!"]
	quest.0000000000001014.title: "Splitting the Atom"
	quest.0000000000001015.quest_desc: ["The Centrifuge is mandatory for splitting uranium isotopes and heavy chemicals to refine fuel grades into weaponized Plutonium or high-power cells."]
	quest.0000000000001015.title: "Isotopic Isolate"
	quest.0000000000001016.quest_desc: ["The pinnacle of technology in Modern Industrialization 2.5.x on Minecraft 1.21.1. The Quantum Circuit manipulates states of light and matter to achieve absolute process automation."]
	quest.0000000000001016.title: "Subatomic Singularity"
	quest.0000000000001017.quest_desc: ["Using UU-Matter and extreme energy thresholds, the Replicator materializes solid items out of pure data patterns. You have mastered industrial science."]
	quest.0000000000001017.title: "The Ultimate Replicator"
	quest.0000000000003001.quest_desc: [
		"The red wood of Grongle is highly resistant to moisture."
		""
		"Reinforced with an Utherium crystal at its center, it allows you to build your first power source: the Water Wheel."
	]
	quest.0000000000003001.title: "Power of the Grongle"
	quest.0000000000003002.quest_desc: [
		"To encapsulate your machinery, you must harness local wood types."
		""
		"Grongle wood paired with Andesite alloy forms your baseline structural casing, while precious Wigglewood married to Brass opens the gateway to advanced machinery."
	]
	quest.0000000000003002.title: "Undergarden Casings"
	quest.0000000000004001.quest_desc: [
		"Utherium is a material of absolute density and sharpness."
		""
		"Its crystals and massive blocks act as heavy pistons and core components for your most demanding Create machinery."
	]
	quest.0000000000004001.title: "Density of Utherium"
	quest.0000000000004002.quest_desc: [
		"You've arrived. By exploiting Utherium for raw weight/sharpness and Regalium for mechanical management, you now command the industrial trinity."
		""
		"The Press, the Saw, and the Mixer will allow you to process your materials in a fully automated layout."
	]
	quest.0000000000004002.title: "The Industrial Trio"
	quest.0000000000004003.quest_desc: [
		"Manipulating liquids requires robust infrastructure."
		""
		"Your copper plumbing and Depthrock-shielded tanks allow you to safely transport and contain the fluids crucial to your upcoming tech milestones."
	]
	quest.0000000000004003.title: "Fluid Dynamics"
