	quest.4737DB4D641207F6.quest_desc: [
		"Finally, well done! You've almost finished the modpack, and I want to say I'm sorry because players love Draconic Evolution and especially Mekanism."
		""
		"But in my opinion, these mods are too common in almost 70% of the modpacks I've played."
		""
		"In a future version of this modpack, that is to say, Thermal Create To Sky Expansion 2, they will remain faithful to the players who love these mods, and of course, when I say players, I also include female players."
	]
